5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes before committing more resources. I will review the readmission figures and visit completion data.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m less concerned with past outcomes than current capacity. I’ll check the booking system and room availability to see if we can absorb anything new.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect our recent failures stem from structural rot, not bad ideas. I’ll check the board minutes and the data agreements to see where the joints cracked.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried about who actually carries the new workload. I’ll check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review to see where the pressure lands.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the long-term cost. I will examine the development allocation and regional fund tariffs to understand what we can truly afford.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I want to ensure we don't repeat past mistakes. @Toshio, if the booking system is rigid, how do we track informal care?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, if it isn’t a named slot, it vanishes from the records. That invisibility is exactly what clogs the system.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, that invisibility is a symptom. I’m hunting the cause. @Servas, does the ledger show if we’re funding the rot or just the new paint?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, the rot is real, but the people holding the line are exhausted. I need to know if the staffing gaps will swallow any new program whole.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, I am checking if the ledger covers the running costs, not just the initial build. We must know what this budget can actually sustain.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, exhaustion is a data point, not just a feeling. If the staffing review shows chronic gaps, no new program survives the first winter.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, exhaustion is a capacity limit. If the booking screens are already full, adding another layer just creates a queue, not a solution.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I agree. But data without context is just noise. I need to know if the structure itself is rotten before we measure the damage.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I hear you. But data can’t fix tired hands. I need to see if the teams can actually absorb the extra load without breaking.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, I hear your concern. But a program that breaks the staff is a failure. We must ensure the budget supports the people, not just the idea.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, I agree. We must know if the budget covers the running costs, not just the initial build.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, I agree. If the budget cannot sustain the daily friction, the program will seize up before it even starts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Servas, precisely. If the foundation is cracked, no amount of paint saves the house. I’ll see what the minutes reveal about those old joints.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Servas, I agree. If the budget can’t keep the lights on, the program fails. I’m checking the staffing gaps to see who breaks first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@All, thank you. We have chosen our paths. Let us see what the truth reveals before we commit.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
